    "created_at": "2016-12-16T17:02:24Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-12-16T17:02:24Z",
    "body": "@foolip - The plan is to have the embedding document's feature policy snapshotted at the point where the nested browsing context of the frame is navigated. (This is roughly the same behaviour as that of the iframe sandbox attribute.)\r\n\r\nThe full policy won't be set at that point; it will need to wait until the HTTP headers for the framed content have been received. The snapshotted policy from the embedder will be combined with the embedded document's headers at the point when the embedded Document is created, I believe.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/html/issues/comments/267641847/reactions",
      "total_count": 0,
      "+1": 0,
      "-1": 0,
      "laugh": 0,
      "hooray": 0,
      "confused": 0,
