    "created_at": "2016-12-16T17:18:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-12-16T17:18:39Z",
    "body": "@clelland the iframe sandbox attribute is snapshotted, per spec, when the new document in the subframe is created.  That's certainly what Firefox does.  Is that not what Chrome does?\r\n\r\nI expected feature policy to work exactly the same way, based on the explainer, which says \"Define an inherited policy for feature for origin when document is initialized\".",
