    "updated_at": "2016-12-16T18:24:57Z",
    "body": "Thanks, @bzbarsky -- you're right there -- it's part of [Initializing a new Document object], and it looks like Chrome follows the spec. That means we definitely *can* resolve the policy inherited from the parent at the same time that we construct the policy for the child.",
